sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User Browser
    participant IstioGW as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant BFF as BFF (model-registry-ui)<br/>8080/TCP Istio mTLS
    participant Registry as model-registry-service<br/>8080/TCP Istio mTLS
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432 TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as InferenceService Controller<br/>8081/TCP probes
    participant CSI as mr-storage-initializer
    participant Storage as S3 / GCS / HuggingFace<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AsyncJob as async-upload Job

    Note over User,DB: Flow 1: Model Registration (UI)
    User->>IstioGW: HTTPS/443<br/>Auth: OAuth2/OIDC (oauth2-proxy)
    IstioGW->>BFF: HTTP/8080<br/>Istio mTLS<br/>AuthorizationPolicy (principal)
    BFF->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>SubjectAccessReview<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: RBAC decision
    BFF->>Registry: HTTP/8080<br/>Istio mTLS<br/>Bearer token or internal SA
    Registry->>DB: TCP/3306 or 5432<br/>Username/Password
    DB-->>Registry: Query result
    Registry-->>BFF: Model metadata
    BFF-->>IstioGW: Response
    IstioGW-->>User: JSON Response

    Note over Controller,Registry: Flow 2: InferenceService Sync (Controller)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>Watch InferenceServices<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: InferenceService events
    Controller->>Registry: HTTP/8080<br/>TLS (configurable)<br/>Bearer token
    Registry-->>Controller: Model metadata
    Controller->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>Patch labels/finalizers

    Note over AsyncJob,OCI: Flow 3: Async Model Upload (Job)
    AsyncJob->>Storage: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / HF API key
    Storage-->>AsyncJob: Model artifacts
    AsyncJob->>AsyncJob: Sigstore signing<br/>(rh-model-signing)
    AsyncJob->>OCI: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>Registry credentials
    OCI-->>AsyncJob: Push confirmation
    AsyncJob->>Registry: HTTP/8080<br/>Istio mTLS<br/>Bearer token
    Registry-->>AsyncJob: Registration confirmed

    Note over CSI,Storage: Flow 4: Model Download (CSI Storage Initializer)
    CSI->>Registry: HTTP/8080<br/>model-registry:// URI resolution
    Registry-->>CSI: Artifact URI + metadata
    CSI->>Storage: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>Per-protocol credentials
    Storage-->>CSI: Model files
